@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@token = REPLACE_ACCESS_TOKEN
@workspaceId = REPLACE_WORKSPACE_ID
@taskId = REPLACE_TASK_ID

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Admin Remiyu",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "RemiyuDemo2026!"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "RemiyuDemo2026!"
}

### Create Workspace
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Tim Operasional","platform":"WHATSAPP"}

### List Workspaces
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Import chat (JetBrains HTTP Client, file relative to this file)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/imports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=RemiyuBoundary

--RemiyuBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample-chat.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ../mockoon/sample-chat.txt
--RemiyuBoundary--

### Drafts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/tasks?status=DRAFT
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Confirm task
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"IN_PROGRESS"}

### Agenda
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/agendas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Kirim hasil tugas (file opsional; tautan atau file wajib)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=SubmissionBoundary

--SubmissionBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="link"

https://example.com/hasil-tugas
--SubmissionBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="note"

Hasil tugas selesai.
--SubmissionBoundary--

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
